    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TimeParadox</strong> is a solitaire-inspired game focused on arranging and organizing cards using various functional cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/e3f82bbaf73383ccb4e4be46801cb183.poster.avif?t=1741014565\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/e3f82bbaf73383ccb4e4be46801cb183.webm?t=1741014565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It incorporates time travel and astronomy elements, creating a relaxing and engaging experience. Your goal is to move required cards to their destinations and sort them in a circular ascending sequence. Every card on the board matters\u2014every move is a puzzle, and every decision leads to new possibilities, dramatically altering the course of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/8ae10dcaa6e3c95db657ad2f689560e4.poster.avif?t=1741014565\" width=800 height=109 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/8ae10dcaa6e3c95db657ad2f689560e4.webm?t=1741014565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The definitive endless game experience</strong>: Keep going, universe explorer\u2014venture into infinity and become infinite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless possibilities</strong>: Every choice, discard, and card usage can dramatically change the outcome of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time travel and immersive cosmic themes</strong>: Dive deep into the mysteries of the universe and experience a unique blend of strategy and discovery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combination of <strong>control cards</strong> and <strong>stop cards</strong> to strategically advance through time, unlocking powerful <strong>special cards</strong> that depict pivotal astronomical and evolutionary events. Every move is a test of strategy, and every decision brings you closer to mastering the art of time travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/ba97a9966a56b4c42f817c0785937ff5.poster.avif?t=1741014565\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/ba97a9966a56b4c42f817c0785937ff5.webm?t=1741014565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes TimeParadox Unique:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ digit cards</strong>: Make the game full of endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ control cards</strong>: Allow for massive possibilities in movement and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ special cards</strong>: Each with unique abilities that redefine your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse events</strong>: Each event introduces a distinct challenge, adding depth and strategic complexity to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging goals</strong>: Organizing and moving objectives add complexity, surpassing traditional solitaire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive card designs</strong>: Featuring celestial objects, historical milestones, and significant events for a captivating experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/1da3be392e62394a079cc41608088f35.poster.avif?t=1741014565\" width=800 height=147 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457070/extras/1da3be392e62394a079cc41608088f35.webm?t=1741014565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mysterious universe. Let curiosity wash over you\u2014relax, escape the daily grind, and prepare to explore the ultimate infinite cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your card collection and uncover new mysteries with every single run. Use the in-depth stats screen to study your best moves, plan ahead, and extend your gameplay. Enjoy detailed, stylish universe-inspired art and let the wonders of astronomy guide your journey.</p>",
